context_info = ()
for d in context:
    result = llm_query("You are given a document. Your task is to find candidate answers for this user query:\n\nQUERY: \"Provide the name of a game developed by a software company named after an amphibian, yet the company had a different name in the early 1990s when it was first established. The game was published in the early 1990s in November on DOS and is single-player shareware. Exactly three people are credited for the game, and two of them share the same family name.\"\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Read the document below. Extract any games and companies that could satisfy all or part of the query.\n- For each candidate game found in this document, list:\n  - Title\n  - Developer (and note if the developer name is amphibian-themed, and what its earlier name was when first established in the early 1990s)\n  - Publisher (if relevant)\n  - Release month and year (specifically check if it’s November in the early 1990s)\n  - Platform(s) (verify DOS)\n  - Game modes (verify single-player only)\n  - Business model (verify shareware)\n  - Credits: list the credited people; explicitly state if there are exactly three and whether two share the same family name\n  - Quotes: include verbatim lines from the document that support the details (release date, platform, mode, shareware, credits, developer name and its earlier name)\n  - Assessment: Does this candidate match ALL constraints? If not, which constraints are missing?\n- If the document includes information about companies named after amphibians (frog, toad, salamander, newt, axolotl, caecilian) that had a different name at establishment in the early 1990s, list them with their old and new names and dates, with quotes.\n- If the document does not contain relevant info, say \"No candidates in this document.\"\n\nBEGIN_DOCUMENT\n" + d + "\nEND_DOCUMENT")
    context_info = context_info + (result,)

synthesis = llm_query("You will receive extracted notes from multiple documents. Your goal is to answer the original query as precisely as possible.\n\nORIGINAL QUERY:\n\"Provide the name of a game developed by a software company named after an amphibian, yet the company had a different name in the early 1990s when it was first established. The game was published in the early 1990s in November on DOS and is single-player shareware. Exactly three people are credited for the game, and two of them share the same family name.\"\n\nNOTES FROM DOCUMENTS:\n" + "\n\n-----\n\n".join(context_info) + "\n\nTASK:\n- From the candidates, choose the single best match that satisfies ALL constraints. Use the quotes provided to verify each requirement:\n  1) Developer is a company named after an amphibian, and that company had a different name in the early 1990s when it was first established (state both names).\n  2) The game was released in November in the early 1990s.\n  3) Platform includes DOS.\n  4) Single-player only.\n  5) Shareware business model.\n  6) Exactly three credited people, with two sharing the same family name.\n- If multiple candidates seem close, prefer the one with explicit quoted evidence fulfilling all constraints.\n- Output ONLY the exact title of the correct game, with no extra words, punctuation, or explanations.")
return_result(synthesis)